      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 5.37,
          "en": "So now that we got started with NextJS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.37,
          "end": 8.79,
          "en": "and we at least have a first basic understanding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.79,
          "end": 11.31,
          "en": "of why we might want to use it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.31,
          "end": 15.15,
          "en": "it's time to create our first NextJS project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.15,
          "end": 16.32,
          "en": "Now for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.32,
          "end": 21.24,
          "en": "you can run the command you find here on NextJS.org.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.24,
          "end": 24.12,
          "en": "Though for this command to succeed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.12,
          "end": 28.59,
          "en": "you need to have NodeJS installed on your system.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.59,
          "end": 32.34,
          "en": "We're not going to write too much NodeJS code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.34,
          "end": 36.54,
          "en": "though we will use some NodeJS later in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.54,
          "end": 40.29,
          "en": "But NextJS needs NodeJS under the hood.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.29,
          "end": 43.38,
          "en": "And this command here, which we wanna run,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.38,
          "end": 46.95,
          "en": "also needs NodeJS to be installed because under the hood,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.95,
          "end": 50.13,
          "en": "this command will use the Node Package Manager",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.13,
          "end": 54.15,
          "en": "for installing dependencies like the NextJS framework.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.15,
          "end": 58.47,
          "en": "Therefore, from nodejs.org, you should download the latest,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.47,
          "end": 62.01,
          "en": "or the latest LTS version, doesn't really matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 62.01,
          "end": 64.59,
          "en": "And install NodeJS on your system.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.59,
          "end": 67.08,
          "en": "It is available for all operating systems.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.08,
          "end": 69.33,
          "en": "Simply download it from this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.33,
          "end": 71.03999999999999,
          "en": "walk through the installer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.03999999999999,
          "end": 73.35,
          "en": "And once you have NodeJS installed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.35,
          "end": 76.38,
          "en": "you can run this command here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.38,
          "end": 78.39,
          "en": "So for that, copy this command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.39,
          "end": 80.61,
          "en": "And then in your terminal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.61,
          "end": 83.49,
          "en": "your default system command prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.49,
          "end": 86.52,
          "en": "navigate into the folder with the CD command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.52,
          "end": 89.78999999999999,
          "en": "where you want to create your NextJS project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.78999999999999,
          "end": 91.77,
          "en": "And once you are in that folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.77,
          "end": 93.963,
          "en": "you can execute this command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.37,
          "end": 97.53,
          "en": "Now when you execute this command,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.53,
          "end": 99.6,
          "en": "you might be asked to confirm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.6,
          "end": 101.64,
          "en": "that you wan to install some dependencies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.64,
          "end": 104.07,
          "en": "and then thereafter, as a first step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.07,
          "end": 107.07,
          "en": "you will be asked which name you want to assign",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.07,
          "end": 108.53999999999999,
          "en": "to your project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.53999999999999,
          "end": 111.96000000000001,
          "en": "And here I'll simply pick nextjs-course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.96000000000001,
          "end": 114.33,
          "en": "Though the name of course is up to you.",
