        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.33,
          "end": 116.25,
          "en": "Now after you confirmed this name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.25,
          "end": 119.91,
          "en": "you will be asked a couple of other questions as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.91,
          "end": 120.743,
          "en": "For example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.743,
          "end": 123.48,
          "en": "whether you want to use TypeScript for this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.48,
          "end": 127.08,
          "en": "And here I'll choose no so that everyone can follow along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.08,
          "end": 128.13,
          "en": "with this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.13,
          "end": 131.31,
          "en": "Because whilst you can use NextJS with TypeScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.31,
          "end": 133.88,
          "en": "it's of course not a must-do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 133.88,
          "end": 135.99,
          "en": "And I want to make sure that everyone can get the most",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.99,
          "end": 136.95,
          "en": "out of this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.95,
          "end": 139.68,
          "en": "no matter if you do know TypeScript or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.68,
          "end": 141.45,
          "en": "Hence, I'll choose no here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.45,
          "end": 144.48,
          "en": "I'll also choose no for ESLint",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 144.48,
          "end": 147.75,
          "en": "and for a Tailwind CSS, which we could use for a styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.75,
          "end": 150.81,
          "en": "But I will provide some finished CSS code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.81,
          "end": 153.39,
          "en": "to you as part of this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.39,
          "end": 156.75,
          "en": "I will also choose no for this source directory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 156.75,
          "end": 159.87,
          "en": "This option would simply change the structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 159.87,
          "end": 163.38,
          "en": "of the created project folder, and I don't want that.",
