          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 174,
          "end": 177.9,
          "en": "and explain why I won't use the App Router just yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 177.9,
          "end": 180.6,
          "en": "and why this of course might change in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 180.6,
          "end": 183.42,
          "en": "But for the moment, you should choose no here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.42,
          "end": 186.15,
          "en": "And you can also choose no for the follow-up question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 186.15,
          "end": 189.48,
          "en": "And then after going through all these questions,",
